#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:3 b0f8673b43504b89bb92b6b6a3d92836
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計資料"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:8 5ca6fc5619aa4068a05996749b75f09b
msgid "Estimated Qubes OS userbase graph"
msgstr "Qubes OS 估計用戶數圖表"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:12 802b7749c46247e98eae8a930e6ab478
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "常見問題"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:16 7c1f066924334d4da54389c1e822c3c7
msgid "How often is this graph updated?"
msgstr "此圖表多久更新一次？"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:19 446806543552471d8ed8eb77eb46ecdd
msgid "Daily."
msgstr "每日。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:22 5fc9fd80c0a94c5ab258d1211534501a
msgid "Why is the bar for the current month so low?"
msgstr "為什麼當月的長條圖這麼低？"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:25 87afbe98e0f04e438474315d2f29269e
msgid ""
"Since the graph is updated daily, the bar for the current month will be very "
"low at the start of the month and rise gradually until the end of the month."
msgstr "由於圖表每日更新，當月的長條圖在月初會非常低，然後逐漸上升直到月底。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:28 524609a39f2f4a0d830757ebee822885
msgid "How is the userbase estimated?"
msgstr "用戶數是如何估算的？"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:31 c83a18b2a8c44a868805dce3df314b48
msgid ""
"We simply count the number of unique IPv4 addresses that connect to the "
"Qubes update servers each month (except for Tor connections; see :ref:"
"`introduction/statistics:how are tor users counted?`). (**Note:** Users who "
"have manually configured their systems to bypass the metalink and connect "
"directly to a mirror are not counted.)"
msgstr ""
"我們簡單地計算每個月連線到 Qubes 更新伺服器的唯一 IPv4 位址數量（Tor 連線除"
"外；請參閱 :ref:`introduction/statistics:how are tor users counted?`）。（**"
"注意：** 手動設定系統繞過 metalink 直接連線到鏡像站的使用者不會被計算在內。）"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:34 03bb44f8e3174ca8891f5690f9f0818b
msgid "How are Tor users counted?"
msgstr "Tor 使用者是如何計算的？"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:37 5b4479b44ba344d38171b3fdd6af13d7
msgid ""
"We estimate the number of Tor users as a proportion of the total number of "
"*requests* from Tor exit nodes on the assumption that the proportion of "
"users to requests is roughly the same for both clearnet and Tor users. To be "
"precise, the formula is:"
msgstr ""
"我們根據 Tor 出口節點的*請求*總數來估算 Tor 使用者數量，假設使用者與請求的比"
"例在明網和 Tor 使用者中大致相同。確切的公式是："

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:45 412986cfc2c04296ac235456ddb96102
msgid "Where:"
msgstr "其中："

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:47 f6e22dc41ce44946a15220277f54a5ee
msgid ""
"``tor_users`` is the estimated number of Qubes users who download updates "
"via Tor each month."
msgstr "``tor_users`` 是每月透過 Tor 下載更新的 Qubes 使用者的估計數量。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:49 b0f81689e90e44d69ee070a7276c9c27
msgid ""
"``tor_requests`` is the total number of requests the Qubes update servers "
"receive from Tor exit nodes each month."
msgstr ""
"``tor_requests`` 是 Qubes 更新伺服器每月從 Tor 出口節點收到的請求總數。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:51 ff9d1ef1028c4063857c7d3bad9eab39
msgid ""
"``plain_users`` is the number of unique clearnet IPv4 addresses that connect "
"to the Qubes update servers each month."
msgstr ""
"``plain_users`` 是每月連線到 Qubes 更新伺服器的唯一明網 IPv4 位址數量。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:53 5cca14a5e1904a19b2a762cc87adc355
msgid ""
"``plain_requests`` is the total number of requests the Qubes update servers "
"receive from clearnet IPv4 addresses each month."
msgstr ""
"``plain_requests`` 是 Qubes 更新伺服器每月從明網 IPv4 位址收到的請求總數。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:57 3c036d49e5d3488bbf43d658cf98ded0
msgid ""
"We cross-reference the list of connecting IP addresses with `TorDNSEL’s exit "
"lists <https://metrics.torproject.org/collector.html#type-tordnsel>`__ in "
"order to distinguish Tor and clearnet IPs and requests. For this purpose, we "
"count an IP address as belonging to a Tor exit node if there was a Tor exit "
"node active for that address within the 24-hour periods before or after it "
"connected to the Qubes update servers."
msgstr ""
"我們將連線 IP 位址清單與 `TorDNSEL 的出口清單 <https://metrics.torproject."
"org/collector.html#type-tordnsel>`__ 進行交叉比對，以區分 Tor 和明網的 IP 及"
"請求。為此，如果某個 IP 位址在連線到 Qubes 更新伺服器前後的 24 小時內有 Tor "
"出口節點處於活動狀態，我們就將該 IP 計為屬於 Tor 出口節點。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:60 61da490f7be544d6889acb633ecc5392
msgid "What kinds of data do you collect about Qubes users?"
msgstr "你們收集哪些關於 Qubes 使用者的資料？"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:63 8d5de1f241b344e78bf27bb9ed07cd2e
msgid "Please see our :doc:`Privacy Policy </introduction/privacy>`."
msgstr "請參閱我們的 :doc:`隱私政策 </introduction/privacy>`。"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:66 28a773df38b642ad9e00fc1a0b2f7b09
msgid "Where can I find the raw data and source code?"
msgstr "我在哪裡可以找到原始資料和原始碼？"

#: ../../../introduction/statistics.rst:69 fdacb0ff63bb437ebe5226363d90f211
msgid ""
"The raw data is available `here <https://tools.qubes-os.org/counter/stats."
"json>`__. (This does not include any personally-identifying user data.) "
"Please note that the format of this data is not documented and may change "
"any time if the developers feel the need to include something else. The "
"source code is available `here <https://github.com/woju/qubes-stats>`__."
msgstr ""
"原始資料可`在此處 <https://tools.qubes-os.org/counter/stats.json>`__ 取得。"
"（這不包括任何個人識別使用者資料。）請注意，此資料的格式未經文件記錄，如果開"
"發人員覺得需要加入其他內容，可能隨時變更。原始碼可`在此處 <https://github."
"com/woju/qubes-stats>`__ 取得。"
